{"id":"consecuencia","lemma":"consecuencia","pos":"noun","rank":1978,"glosses":["consequence"],"ipa":"/konseˈkwenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"consecuencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-consecuencia.wav","formAudio":{"consecuencias":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/79/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-consecuencias.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Ha habido consecuencias?","en":"Have there been consequences?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804022","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]},{"text":"Tom conoce las consecuencias.","en":"Tom knows the stakes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801259","words":[null,{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Muchas personas murieron a consecuencia de la guerra.","en":"As a result of the war, many people died.","words":[{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"to"},null,null,null,{"g":"war, warfare"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]},{"text":"Toda acción tiene sus consecuencias.","en":"Every action has its consequence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354037","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"action, act, deed"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"Va a haber consecuencias.","en":"There are going to be consequences.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585812","words":[{"g":"okay"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to have"},null]}]}